#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/jax-compatibility.rst:13
msgid ""
"`JAX <https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/notebooks/thinking_in_jax.html>`__ "
"is a library for array-oriented numerical computation (similar to NumPy),"
" with automatic differentiation and just-in-time (JIT) compilation to "
"enable high-performance machine learning research."
msgstr ""
"` JAX <https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/notebooks/thinking_in_jax.html> ` __ は"
"、配列指向の数値計算（NumPyに類似）を行うライブラリであり、自動微分および"
"ジャストインタイム（JIT）コンパイル機能を備えており、高性能な機械学習研究を実"
"現します。"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/jax-compatibility.rst:17
msgid ""
"JAX provides an API that combines automatic differentiation and the "
"Accelerated Linear Algebra (XLA) compiler to achieve high-performance "
"machine learning at scale. JAX uses composable transformations of Python "
"and NumPy through JIT compilation, automatic vectorization, and "
"parallelization."
msgstr ""
"JAXは、自動微分とAccelerated Linear Algebra（XLA）コンパイラを組み合わせたAPI"
"を提供し、大規模かつ高性能な機械学習を実現します。JAXは、JITコンパイル、自動"
"ベクトル化、および並列化を通じて、PythonおよびNumPyの変換を組み合わせることを"
"可能にします。"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/jax-compatibility.rst:25
msgid ""
