#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/tensorflow-compatibility.rst:270
msgid ""
"Operations for matrix and tensor computations, such as "
"``tf.linalg.matmul`` (matrix multiplication), ``tf.linalg.inv`` (matrix "
"inversion) and ``tf.linalg.cholesky`` (Cholesky decomposition). These "
"leverage GPUs for high-performance linear algebra operations."
